{"q":"415","t":"Add Strings","d":"Easy","p":false,"c":"<p>Given two non-negative integers, <code>num1</code> and <code>num2</code> represented as string, return <em>the sum of</em> <code>num1</code> <em>and</em> <code>num2</code> <em>as a string</em>.</p>\n\n<p>You must solve the problem without using any built-in library for handling large integers (such as <code>BigInteger</code>). You must also not convert the inputs to integers directly.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> num1 = &quot;11&quot;, num2 = &quot;123&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> &quot;134&quot;\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> num1 = &quot;456&quot;, num2 = &quot;77&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> &quot;533&quot;\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> num1 = &quot;0&quot;, num2 = &quot;0&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> &quot;0&quot;\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= num1.length, num2.length &lt;= 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>num1</code> and <code>num2</code> consist of only digits.</li>\n\t<li><code>num1</code> and <code>num2</code> don&#39;t have any leading zeros except for the zero itself.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{ \r\n  \"name\": \"addStrings\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    { \r\n      \"name\": \"num1\",\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    },\r\n    { \r\n      \"name\": \"num2\",\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"string\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Math","slug":"math"},{"name":"String","slug":"string"},{"name":"Simulation","slug":"simulation"}],"s":[{"t":"Add Two Numbers","s":"add-two-numbers","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Multiply Strings","s":"multiply-strings","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Add to Array-Form of Integer","s":"add-to-array-form-of-integer","d":"Easy","p":false}],"co":[["Google","google"],["Meta","facebook"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["Visa","visa"],["Capital One","capital-one"],["Uber","uber"],["Oracle","oracle"],["Airbnb","airbnb"]],"cs":{"a":[["Google","google",2]],"b":[["Amazon","amazon",4],["Meta","facebook",3]],"m":[["TikTok","tiktok",10],["Microsoft","microsoft",8],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",4],["Capital One","capital-one",4],["Oracle","oracle",3],["Uber","uber",3],["Visa","visa",3],["Yandex","yandex",3],["Wayfair","wayfair",2],["Jane Street","jane-street",2]]}}